  1. Return false

1. Else Dangling#49

2. If ((n_len < n_len')), then

  1. If ((n_len < |t|)), then

    1. Case analysis on t[n_len]

      1. Case (% = t_c)

        1. Return true

      2. Case (% =/= t_c)

        1. Return $contains'((n_len + 1), n_len', t, t_c)

  1. Else Dangling#52

2. Else Dangling#51

